    </div><div class="section-20">
      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 class="h2-prix">Questions we get asked about <span class="gradient-text"><strong>online ordering</strong>:</span></h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce41e-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce41e" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How much does an online ordering solution for a restaurant cost?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">At Innovorder, €139/month. The subscription covers click-and-collect, delivery, in-store ordering, a white-label website, and synchronization with your point-of-sale system. Innovorder charges no commission on your sales; only online payment fees apply.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce429-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce429" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Are there any free online ordering solutions?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, several software providers offer a free module. These modules allow you to receive orders, but without integration with the point-of-sale system or a production screen: each order must be re-entered manually. The cost shifts from the subscription fee to your teams’ time.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce434-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce434" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How is it different from Uber Eats or Deliveroo?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Platforms provide visibility and charge a commission on each order. When selling directly, you only pay credit card processing fees—around 2.5% on a €25 order: 97.5% of the price paid by the customer goes to you, compared to 70% at a platform’s standard rate. The two are complementary: Innovorder also integrates with Uber Eats and Deliveroo.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce43f-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce43f" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Do you need to already have a website?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No. Innovorder creates your ordering site in your name and with your branding. If you have a showcase website, a “Order” button is all it takes to link to it. If you don’t have one, your ordering site works on its own and can be shared on your social media.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce44a-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce44a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Does Innovorder charge a commission on my sales?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No. The subscription fee is fixed, regardless of your order volume. The only variable fees are those for credit card payments, charged by our partner Stripe: 1.5% plus €0.25 per transaction for European cards, which is approximately 2.5% on a €25 order. These are the same fees as for a standard cash transaction.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce455-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce455" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How does online ordering work for restaurants?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No installation is required. Your customers place orders through a website created by Innovorder to reflect your brand, choosing to pick up their order at a time slot of their choice, have it delivered, or eat in. The orders are then sent directly to your point-of-sale software and displayed on your production screen.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce460-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce460" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I manage my own delivery drivers or do I have to go through a partner?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The choice is yours: your own fleet or an external partner like Stuart. You can also set up custom delivery zones by adjusting the distance, fees, and available delivery times.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce46b-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce46b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I choose how my customers pay?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. Online payment is required, payment at the counter upon pickup, or both—whichever the customer prefers—and payment upon delivery. You pay for each ride separately.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce476-6643cbb9" data-w-id="3c54dd0c-99b4-571e-4694-b0610e3ce476" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I modify my menu on my own?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. You can add or remove dishes, adjust prices, and create promotions with just a few clicks from your back office—and choose which service options each item is available for.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
